      "content": "it's just so hard to see them struggle because of me. like, i look at my husband and i see how much he's giving up just to stay by my side. it almost feels like i'm holding them hostage to my illness. if i could just find a way to make it stop for everyone... would that really be such a bad thing? to just let them be free?",
